    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Also my code is here as I try to read each rowgroup in each `read_parquet` call for benchmarking stream parallelism:\n```python\nimport sys\nimport pylibcudf as plc\nimport rmm\nimport os\nfrom rmm.pylibrmm.stream import Stream, DEFAULT_STREAM\nimport threading\n\npool = rmm.mr.PoolMemoryResource(rmm.mr.CudaMemoryResource(), initial_pool_size=\"10GiB\", maximum_pool_size=\"30GiB\")\nrmm.mr.set_current_device_resource(pool)\nfile = sys.argv[1]\nNUM_THREAD = int(sys.argv[2])\nREAD_REPEAT = int(sys.argv[3])\ncol_name = sys.argv[4]\nsource = plc.io.SourceInfo([file])\nmeta = plc.io.parquet_metadata.read_parquet_metadata(source)\nprint(\"num_rowgroups: \", meta.num_rowgroups())\nprint(\"column: \", col_name)\n\nchunk_size = meta.num_rowgroups() // NUM_THREAD\nthreads_options = []\n# Creating all options\nfor i in range(NUM_THREAD):\n    options_list = []\n    start_rg = i * chunk_size\n    end_rg = start_rg + chunk_size if i < NUM_THREAD - 1 else meta.num_rowgroups()\n    for rg in range(start_rg, end_rg):\n        options = plc.io.parquet.ParquetReaderOptions.builder(\n            plc.io.SourceInfo([file])\n        ).build()\n        options.set_row_groups([[rg]])\n        options.set_columns([col_name])\n        options_list.append(options)\n    threads_options.append(options_list)\n\n# Creating all streams\nstream_list = []\nfor i in range(NUM_THREAD):\n    stream_list.append(rmm.pylibrmm.stream.Stream())\n\ndef thread_read(file, options_list, stream):\n    for options in options_list:\n        plc.io.parquet.read_parquet(options, stream)\n    stream.synchronize()\n\nthreads = []\nfor iter in range(READ_REPEAT):\n    for i in range(NUM_THREAD):\n        t = threading.Thread(\n            target=thread_read,\n            args=(file, threads_options[i], stream_list[i]),\n        )\n        threads.append(t)\n        t.start()\n    for t in threads:\n        t.join()\n```",
